{"@type":"Question","name":"What is BotBento: Seller Box?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"A workflow kit for online sellers: 20 AI mini-agent workflow cards for listings, reviews, customer messages, store ops and growth — plus a dated 2026 marketplace policy reference with sources, the offline Listing Lab compliance checker, a seller roles library, example walkthroughs, a run tracker and a Notion database. Each card gives the AI a job, your facts, the platform's rules, an output format, a review step and a next action."}},
{"@type":"Question","name":"Do I need code, APIs or automation tools?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"No. The cards run inside the AI chat assistant you already use, and Listing Lab is a single file that opens in any browser and works offline. Nothing to install, no accounts to create."}},
