{"@type":"Question","name":"How is this different from the Agent Box?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The Agent Box (Kit Nº 02) is the general workflow kit for any small business. The Seller Box is specialized for selling online: marketplace rules are built into the cards, the review workflows are compliance-safe by design, and it ships with the Listing Lab checker. They share the same operating loop and stack well."}},
{"@type":"Question","name":"Will this make me money?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"We don't promise income or sales — anyone who does is selling you something else. The kit saves drafting hours and helps your listings survive platform rules. Your products, prices and effort decide the rest."}},
